  "goodToKnow": "Das Korn is grain or a single seed: Getreidekorn, Pfefferkorn, Sandkorn. Vollkorn means wholegrain: Vollkornbrot. It's a false friend: corn (maize) is der Mais. Der Korn, with a different gender, is a clear grain schnapps from northern Germany. Das Korn is also the front sight of a gun, hence etwas aufs Korn nehmen (to take aim at, satirise). Die Körner is the plural for seeds; Körnerfresser jokingly means health-food fan."
